## Consciousness, Qualia & The Hard Problem

> **SYLVA Insight**: Philosophy of mind addresses the mind-body problem: how does consciousness relate to the physical? The hard problem of consciousness asks why there is subjective experience at all. SYLVA's emergence principle offers a framework for this question.

**Author**: SYLVA Formalization Team
**Version**: v8.0
**Date**: 2026-07-25

## Imports
- Mathlib
- SylvaFormalization.SYLVA_Hierarchy
- SylvaFormalization.SYLVA_Emergence
